// Crossfade key bindings. This file is applied after the bundled keymap, so a binding
// here wins. The format is Zed's: a list of sections, each with an optional key context
// and a map of keystrokes to actions. Bind a key to null to unbind it.
//
// For example, to start a conversion with cmd-shift-enter as well:
// [
//   {
//     "context": "Workspace",
//     "bindings": {
//       "cmd-shift-enter": "crossfade::Convert"
//     }
//   }
// ]
[]
